0.1.0-alpha.1:
  Initial alpha release of Phantom Power.
  Add PhantomPowerSensor with linear dimmer and fan speed scaling.
  Support configurable device registry linking (link_device).
  Add multi-state and attribute rule matching (states) on power sensors with case-insensitive value and contains operators.
  Add realistic power variance jitter (variance) to synthesize natural electrical fluctuations.
  Add PhantomEnergySensor with continuous Riemann sum power-to-kWh integration and persistent state restoration.
  Add PhantomPowerGroupSensor for multi-entity wattage summation and diagnostics.
  Add YAML configuration loader with hot-reload service (phantom_power.reload).
  Add reset service (phantom_power.reset_energy).
  Add Probatio schema validation engine support with automatic voluptuous fallback.
  Add visual web editor in phantom-power-editor/ with automatic entity discovery, one-click power/energy generation, group management, and Home Assistant webhook synchronization.
  Add Google App Engine deployment configuration (app.yaml) and configure hosted editor URL as default in const.py.
  Fix zlib payload decompression in Phantom Power Editor using pako.
  License under GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0).
  Add install script, HACS metadata, example configurations, and release notes.
